{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced battle simulator with fully destructible buildings. Gather special attacks by filling up the destruction meter on each level, then defeat all the meanies by blasting their towers in strategic locations. Accumulate power-ups to customize the destruction. These structures are flexible which means they will bend and twist before collapsing in spectacular fashion. The meanies will fire back, and you must act quickly to outsmart them. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible real-time 3D building destruction </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >28 unique, structurally engineered levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full VR support, and non-VR play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups and special attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sandbox mode with earthquake simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique personality type characters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/2426d25a33cd424d307cd966a5c6de11.poster.avif?t=1763447558\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/2426d25a33cd424d307cd966a5c6de11.webm?t=1763447558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1691020/extras/2426d25a33cd424d307cd966a5c6de11.mp4?t=1763447558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out sandbox mode demo <strong>available now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh